I need to identify, for each requirement piece, what is trusted to the worker's good character (i.e. the builder opencode, or Codex), rather than enforced by a check the worker cannot edit. The check: run by the COO after each attempt — `bun test` (all frozen tests), `bunx tsgo --noEmit`, the evaluator, sha256 of frozen tests and code_map/eval/ unchanged.

